#: ../../source/index.rst:7 df86bad61a944f638b2695631db8c1bc
msgid ":code:`foc` is a field-oriented-control library for three-phase PMSM drives. One engineering constraint drives every design choice: **the control loop must be predictable** — no heap, no exceptions, no virtual calls, no hidden allocation in the code path that runs every PWM period."
msgstr ":code:`foc` 是面向三相 PMSM 的磁场定向控制（FOC）库。所有设计取舍都服务于同一条工程约束：**控制环必须可预测**——跑在每个 PWM 周期的代码路径里没有堆、没有异常、没有虚函数调用、没有隐式内存分配。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:11 8cdc5e15259d4d928df0b9fd7e09e8ae
