#: ../../source/index.rst:31 79b098060960453dbe917c0ed19603f6
msgid "_`What V1 does`"
msgstr "_`V1 做了什么`"

#: ../../source/index.rst:33 12e5e1a473b64384ab5ddc843334ac43
msgid "Clarke / Park and their inverses, space-vector modulation, PI controllers, a motor state machine and a back-EMF observer."
msgstr "Clarke / Park 及其逆变换、空间矢量调制、PI 控制器、电机状态机与反电动势观测器。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:35 e6c18a1ebf86441d970b36e714b95497
msgid "**Policy-composed motor**: observer, modulator, controller and HAL are template parameters, so the whole current loop inlines into one translation unit."
msgstr "**策略组合的电机**：观测器、调制器、控制器与 HAL 都是模板参数，整条电流环内联进一个翻译单元。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:37 35321079b969404ca734eb9fc8f3bd10
msgid "Simulation-grade HAL stubs (PWM duty history, scripted current, simulated position), so the complete control chain can be exercised without hardware."
msgstr "仿真级 HAL 桩（PWM 占空比历史、脚本化电流、模拟位置），无需硬件即可跑通完整控制链。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:39 78011f1ea9504f8697f1b0cff96a57bd
msgid "A C API with generation-checked opaque handles: a stale handle is *detected*, never dereferenced."
msgstr "带代际校验的不透明句柄的 C API：失效句柄会被*识别*，绝不解引用。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:41 63ecde79c50c4f78a43c245c451a3040
msgid "An optional pybind11 module that binds the **C API**, not the C++ templates."
msgstr "可选的 pybind11 模块，绑定的是 **C API**，不是 C++ 模板。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:43 d4160195556d4ce4bb51e4d62dd97a53
msgid "All of this is verified in software only — see :ref:`honest limits <honest-limits>`."
msgstr "以上全部只在软件层面验证——见 :ref:`诚实边界 <honest-limits>`。"

